@startuml
title Interaction 1 — Request Appointment (UC03; implemented PoC)
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor AdministrativeStaff as Staff
boundary "cli:Main" as UI
control ":ClinicSystem" as System
entity ":AvailabilityCatalog" as Catalog
entity ":AppointmentBook" as Book
entity "clock:Clock" as Clock
Staff -> UI: Identify patient and choose service/professional/date range
UI -> System: searchPatient(query)
System --> UI: matching patients
UI -> System: searchAvailability(serviceId, professionalId, from, to)
System -> Catalog: slots()
Catalog --> System: professional availability
System -> Clock: instant()
loop each matching slot
  System -> System: filter by future start and full service duration
  System -> Book: professionalAvailable(slot, serviceEnd)
  Book --> System: available : boolean
end
System --> UI: available slots (advisory)
UI --> Staff: Display slots; staff selects slotId
Staff -> UI: Book selected slot for clinic/phone request
UI -> System: requestAppointment(patientId, serviceId, slotId, channel, referralId)
group serialized by synchronized ClinicSystem operation
  System -> System: patient(patientId); service(serviceId)
  break patient/service lookup fails
    System --> UI: notFound; no state change
    UI --> Staff: Show lookup error
  end
  System -> Catalog: slot(slotId)
  Catalog --> System: slot (or notFound)
  break slot lookup fails
    System --> UI: notFound; no state change
    UI --> Staff: Show lookup error
  end
  System -> Catalog: professional(slot.professionalId)
  Catalog --> System: professional
  System -> System: validate channel inline
  System -> Clock: instant()
  System -> System: validate future and full duration inline
  break channel, future start or full-duration validation fails
    System --> UI: invalidInput / slotUnavailable; no state change
    UI --> Staff: Show validation error
  end
  System -> Book: professionalAvailable(slot, serviceEnd)
  Book --> System: professionalAvailable : boolean
  opt professional available
    System -> Book: patientAvailable(patientId, start, serviceEnd)
    Book --> System: patientAvailable : boolean
  end
  break professional or patient conflict
    System --> UI: slotUnavailable; no state change
    UI --> Staff: Show conflict; search again if needed
  end
  System -> System: validate referral existence, activity, patient and targets
  alt referral validation fails
    System --> UI: referralRequired / referralInvalid; no state change
    UI --> Staff: Show referral error
  else facade validation passes
    System -> Book: reserve(patient, service, slot, LOCATION, channel, referralId)
    Book -> Book: recheck professionalAvailable() and patientAvailable()
    alt defensive ledger recheck fails
      Book --> System: slotUnavailable; no state change
      System --> UI: slotUnavailable
      UI --> Staff: Show conflict
    else ledger checks pass
      create entity "a:Appointment" as Appointment
      Book -> Appointment: create(uniqueID, patient, service, slot,\nstatus=requested, requestedBy=staff, channel)
      Book -> Book: store(a)
      Book --> System: a
      System --> UI: appointmentID, status = requested
      UI --> Staff: Request recorded (not confirmed)
    end
  end
end
note over System,Book
PoC simplifies O03: slotId supplies professional/location/dateTime; one clinic.
Resources, waitingListEntryID and real auth/audit are NOT implemented here.
Their analysis contracts are deferred; this diagram traces the existing Java subset.
end note
@enduml
